    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <h3>Les Misérables Drama Workshop</h3><p>In this hour-long workshop, students explore the key themes of Victor Hugo’s classic story. Participants discuss the conditions faced by those living in poverty in 1830s France, before creating a series of dramatic tableaus. A series of movement-based drama exercises then lead to recreating the final battle on the barricades.</p><p><strong>Cost: £250 | Suitable ages 12+ | Running time: 1 hour</strong></p>
    </div>
    


                        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->                    </div>

                    <!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]--><!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->
