    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <h3>Les Misérables Musical Theatre Workshop</h3><p>This 90-minute workshop leads students through improvised exercises, to group work developing character and dramatic scenes. A vocal session culminates in learning two musical numbers, <em>At The End Of The Day</em> and <em>Do You Hear The People Sing</em>, as the group works towards re-creating the famous &#039;Barricade&#039; scene.</p><p><strong>Cost: £450 | Suitable ages 12+ | Running time: 1 hour 30 minutes</strong></p>
    </div>
    


